      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":834.0,"y":416.0},"guid":"9a9722d5-4e09-4a50-8e0d-75dd39cc9aac","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"19"},{"member":{"name":"cardType","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"TarotProject.Card","targetTypeName":"TarotProject.Card","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":3245.0,"y":917.0},"guid":"e3711841-23b8-4250-b764-c14d185a0c8a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"3361"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":-634.0},"guid":"cde9b58b-2229-4177-9653-ea6f98be49c2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"3364"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":2,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":586.0,"y":-832.0},"guid":"135b5ed1-fdca-48c9-816a-67a972b160fd","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3366"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":250.0,"y":452.0},"guid":"8bbe03b5-197a-4254-a458-c8f17d9f33a2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3368"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":543.0,"y":-558.0},"guid":"3ba6dc71-95eb-4a30-8dc2-e12749dfbf47","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3370"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[{"name":"aiHand","value":{"$content":[],"$type":"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[UnityEngine.GameObject,
